### ============================================================
### Evalify API - End-to-End Test
### ============================================================
### INSTRUCTIONS:
### 1. اتبع الـ steps بالترتيب
### 2. بعد Login → انسخ token والصقه في @token
### 3. بعد Create Template → انسخ templateId والصقه في @templateId
### 4. بعد Upload Paper → انسخ studentPaperId والصقه في @paperId
###
### الصور:
###   templateTest.png  → template (الورقة الفاضية)
###   20220001.jpg      → student paper (اسم الملف = كود الطالب)
###
### الـ bounding boxes:
###   Q1: x=100, y=100, width=650, height=250
###   Q2: x=100, y=400, width=650, height=250
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7065
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@templateId = PASTE_TEMPLATE_ID_HERE
@paperId = PASTE_PAPER_ID_HERE

### ============================================================
### STEP 1 — Register
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Teacher",
  "email": "teacher@test.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

###

### ============================================================
### STEP 2 — Login → انسخ token من الـ response
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher@test.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

###

### ============================================================
### STEP 3 — Create Template
### انسخ templateId من الـ response
### عدّل المسار لو مختلف عندك
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Computer Science Exam Template
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="templateTest.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< D:\final\AI service\Evalify-main\templateTest.png
------Boundary--

###

### ============================================================
### STEP 4 — Save Questions (bounding boxes)
### Q1: Image Segmentation question
### Q2: Index Representation question
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates/{{templateId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questions": [
    {
      "questionIndex": 1,
      "x": 100,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 250,
      "modelAnswer": "Image segmentation is the process of dividing an image into different regions or segments to simplify analysis and identify objects",
      "mark": 10.0,
      "gradingMode": "Meaning"
    },
    {
      "questionIndex": 2,
      "x": 100,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 250,
      "modelAnswer": "The possible ways for index representation are term document matrix and inverted index",
      "mark": 10.0,
      "gradingMode": "Meaning"
    }
  ]
}

###

### ============================================================
### STEP 5 — Upload Student Paper
### اسم الملف = كود الطالب (20220001)
### انسخ studentPaperId من الـ response
### ============================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates/{{templateId}}/papers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="20220001.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< D:\final\AI service\Evalify-main\20220001.jpg
------Boundary--

###

### ============================================================
### STEP 6 — Get Papers (تابع الـ status)
### Pending → Processing → Done
### شغّله أكتر من مرة لحد ما يبقى Done
### ============================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates/{{templateId}}/papers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================
### STEP 7 — Get Results
### شغّله بعد ما status يبقى Done
### هتشوف: grade, extracted_text, totalGrade
### ============================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/papers/{{paperId}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================
### STEP 8 — Adjust Grade (اختياري)
### عدّل answerId بالـ id الحقيقي من الـ results
### ============================================================

PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/answers/1/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grade": 8.0
}

###

### ============================================================
### STEP 9 — Export CSV
### ============================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/templates/{{templateId}}/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
